sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway
    participant IdempotencyStore as Idempotency store
    participant Worker

    Client->>Gateway: POST /tasks (Idempotency-Key: abc123)
    Gateway->>IdempotencyStore: CAS insert abc123 -> PENDING
    alt Key already PENDING or COMPLETE
        IdempotencyStore-->>Gateway: existing record
        Gateway-->>Client: cached result or 409 in-progress
    else Key newly inserted
        IdempotencyStore-->>Gateway: inserted
        Gateway->>Worker: execute task
        Note over Worker: Network drops before response reaches Gateway
        Client->>Gateway: retry POST /tasks (same Idempotency-Key)
        Gateway->>IdempotencyStore: CAS insert abc123 -> PENDING
        IdempotencyStore-->>Gateway: already PENDING, wait/return in-progress
        Worker-->>Gateway: task result
        Gateway->>IdempotencyStore: abc123 -> COMPLETE, store result
        Gateway-->>Client: result (from the original request's retry)
    end
